---
import lightLogo from "../../../logo/whale-light.png";
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="border-border mt-16 border-t">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1480px] gap-10 px-6 py-12 sm:grid-cols-3">
    <div><img src={lightLogo.src} alt="Longport Whale" class="h-10 w-auto" /><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-4 max-w-xs text-sm">Infrastructure and developer tools for modern brokerage products.</p></div>
    <div><h2 class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold">Products</h2><div class="text-muted-foreground flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm"><a href="/en/whalesdk/overview/">Whale SDK</a><a href="/en/broker-api/overview/">Broker API</a><a href="/en/trading-api/introduction/">Trading API</a></div></div>
    <div><h2 class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold">Resources</h2><div class="text-muted-foreground flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm"><a href="/en/introduction/">Documentation</a><a href="https://github.com/longbridge/whale-docs">GitHub</a></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-border text-muted-foreground border-t px-6 py-5 text-center text-xs">© {year} Longport. All rights reserved.</div>
</footer>
